<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
