<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_10__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any police officer may arrest without a warrant any person whom he reasonably believes to have committed or to be committing an offence against this Act, and every offence against this Act shall be deemed to be seizable offence for the purposes of the law for the time being in force relating to criminal procedure."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
