<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of subsection (1), this Act shall apply if, for the offence in question, the computer, program or data was in Malaysia or capable of being connected to or sent to or used by or with a computer in Malaysia at the material time."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_9> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_III__cl_9__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
