<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "displayed on the screen of a computer; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/3/eng@> .
